DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a veteran of the stage or a brand new baby comic
 \, this workshop accelerates your progress as a stand-up comedian. Professi
 onal comedians\, Saskia Bee and Chase Harter\, provide constructive feedbac
 k in a supportive and engaged group setting. Each participant gets 10 minut
 es of time devoted to their material. You may choose to use your dedicated 
